bonus: the stun bonus provided from previous gags in the track. 
A trap will provide a 10% stun for an incoming lure, and each additional trap will be an extra 5%
A trap activation via lure will provide a 50% bonus for incoming gags. 
Normal gags provide 25% for each stun. 


niche mechanics:
Trap placements, successful lures, Doodle tricks, and toon ups no longer grant stun bonuses

Multi-Lure Mechanics: 
Multiple Lure gags of the same type used simultaneously now grant a bonus
(20/15/10)% Accuracy depending on the gag level discrepancies of the additional
Lure gags, with the bonus being smaller if lower leveled Lure gags are used
○ Group Lures paired with another Group Lure yield ‘Lure Bonus’
○ Dollar Bills paired with another Dollar Bill yield ‘Lure Bonus’
○ Group Lures and Dollar Bills used simultaneously do not grant ‘Lure Bonus’

Basically, take the highest lure as the main accuracy, and the lower/equal lure will give the bonus
10% for $1 and small magnet, 15% for $5 and big magnet, 20% for 10$ and hypnos.
Dont give lure bonus for magnets/hypnos used with bills. 